"""Conversion: BAC 2016 – اللّغة العربيّة وآدابها – شعبة لغات أجنبيّة – الموضوع الأوّل (محمود سامي البارودي، قصيدة في المنفى).
2016 had one ordinary session (header: «دورة: 2016»).
Exam (most faithful source): gdrive 1cDvXvymcohRIm_YbUpcwg5mPp1Tp8NV0 (بكالوريا العربية 2016 شعبة لغات.docx);
same paper as PDF (owner's copy): gdrive 1Tkt8BFSBLdjk1C_TyCscbyJHOircJepb (BAC 2016 - اللغة العربية - لغات أجنبية.pdf);
official ONEC paper: gdrive 1QrXTAPtKWLgkHDz1B6a3qIymOqlAXXnU (01_الموضوع.pdf, pages 1–2 — used to check the docx);
official mark scheme (ONEC «الإجابة النّموذجيّة»): gdrive 1WXyJSZlfGaDINHCwWRNhqxYl_C-Zc-qP (02_التصحيح.pdf, pages 1–2).

Method (same as the BAC 2017–2023 converters): the verbatim strings below (introduction, poem, reference, glossary,
question texts) were generated from the .docx with python-docx (runs read exactly, tatweel kept; only outer whitespace
and edge direction marks trimmed) and re-checked programmatically against it; the docx was compared with the official
ONEC paper (same verses and questions; underlined «لولا الأهل» and «مزنة» in both; the ONEC paper puts «ريحانة» in
quotation marks in verse 1 — the docx is kept). The correction PDF's text layer is reversed presentation-form Arabic, so
the mark scheme was read from the rendered pages (150 dpi, fully legible). Every mark comes from the official scheme;
correct options and explanations condense its wording.

Conversion notes / points for the owner's review:
- Streams: header of the paper and of the correction: «لغات أجنبيّة» ⇒ LANG.
- The poem table of the docx stores each verse as [عجز, empty, «n-صدر»] ⇒ rows written [n-, صدر, عجز]; verse 1 starts
  with a stray fatha after «1-» in the docx ⇒ dropped (absent from the ONEC paper).
- «n×m» rule used in the 2016 converters: distinct required parts ⇒ one element per part; a list of interchangeable
  items or of evidence / meanings forming one answer ⇒ one element; the main ideas of a plan stay one element.
- Q1 «2×0.5» = the psychological state + its cause. Q2 «4×0.25» = four quotations (one element). Q3: 0.5 + 0.5 = two
  ways of facing his enemies, each with its evidence. Q4 «4×0.25» = four meanings of the wisdom (one element).
  Q5 01 (the scheme gives one closed answer: «راجع إلى واقع التّجربة الشّعوريّة…، أمّا التّعبير عن التّجربة فتابع لها»).
  Q6 «4×0.5» = general idea (0.5) + three main ideas with verse ranges (1.5).
- Q7 (تلخيص الأبيات 9–14) «3×1» = ملاءمة المضمون / مراعاة حجم النّصّ / أسلوب المترشّح ⇒ three deferred essay_builder elements.
- Part 2 Q1 «4×0.25» four words of the exile field among eight. Q2 «4×0.25» = لولا / الأهل / الخبر المحذوف / مزنة
  (four lines ⇒ four elements; no «فاعل» / «اسم لولا» distractor). Q3 «2×0.5» one per sentence. Q4 0.5 (النّفي; «الإنكار»
  not used as a distractor). Q5 per image «3×0.25» = النّوع / الشّرح / سرّ البلاغة («مجاز عقليّ» not used as a distractor).
  Q6 «2×0.5» beside one answer (figure + type + effect) — the scheme does not split it ⇒ one element of 1 («طباق» not
  used as a distractor).
- Part 3 (04): «4×0.5» form + «4×0.5» content with «يكتفي المترشّح بذكر مظهرين من مظاهر التّقليد في الشّكل، ومظهرين
  من مظاهر التّقليد في المضمون، مع ربط كلّ مظهر بالنّصّ» ⇒ per side: two manifestations (1) + their link to the text (1).
  Form manifestations and content manifestations are interactive; the link of the form manifestations to the text is
  deferred (the scheme gives no evidence for them); the link of the content manifestations uses the scheme's own pairings
  (themes in parentheses; Q3, Q4 and Q6 answers for the verses).
- Deferred: summary 3 + part 3 form link 1 = 4 points.
"""
